       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. OWNER.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT SHARED-FILE ASSIGN TO 'SHAREDDD'.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD SHARED-FILE IS GLOBAL.
       01 SHARED-RECORD PIC X(8).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           GOBACK.
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CHILD.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 TARGET-NAME PIC X(8).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE 'KEEP0001' TO TARGET-NAME.
           READ SHARED-FILE.
           CALL TARGET-NAME.
           MOVE 'NEXT0001' TO TARGET-NAME.
           CALL TARGET-NAME.
           GOBACK.
       END PROGRAM CHILD.
       END PROGRAM OWNER.
